{"id":"n84543-1-8","stage":5,"title":"적시다 · 弄湿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84543-1-8-1","ko":"셔츠 앞에 김칫국이 묻었네?","zh":"衬衫前面沾到泡菜汤了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"셔츠","meaning":"衬衫","explanation":"셔츠：衬衫。","readings":[{"term":"셔츠","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64284","senseId":"1","lemma":"셔츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"셔츠","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"5","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"김칫국이","meaning":"辛奇清汤","explanation":"김칫국：辛奇清汤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"김칫국","audio":"/audio/f0df4e20d903e6911e68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26402","senseId":"2","lemma":"김칫국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김칫국이","audio":"/audio/d7a91e35464f027d3b1c.mp3"}},{"text":"묻었네?","meaning":"沾上","explanation":"묻다：沾上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46165","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻었네","audio":"/audio/47264dac460b05de83f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0f9ab32a190bfc01","term":"셔츠","zh":"衬衫","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3","entryId":"64284","definition":"可穿在西装内，也可外穿的西式上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"人体或物体的前面部分。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"f0df4e20d903e691","term":"김칫국","zh":"辛奇清汤","audio":"/audio/f0df4e20d903e6911e68.mp3","entryId":"26402","definition":"放入辛奇煮制而成的汤。","pronunciation":["김치꾹","김칟꾹"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f177